sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as 🖥️ Next.js Web Client
    participant Router as 🛣️ Express Router
    participant Validator as 🛡️ Zod Validation Middleware
    participant Controller as 🎮 Video/Claim Controller
    participant Service as ⚙️ Verification Service
    participant Cache as ⚡ Redis & DB Cache
    participant ExtAPI as 🌐 External APIs (SerpApi/FactCheck)

    %% Scenario A: Process Video Endpoint
    rect rgb(240, 249, 255)
    Note over Client,ExtAPI: Flow A: Process Video (POST /api/videos/process)
    Client->>Router: POST /api/videos/process { youtubeUrl: "https://youtu.be/..." }
    Router->>Validator: Validate body against processVideoSchema
    alt Invalid URL Format
        Validator-->>Client: 400 Bad Request { error: { code: "INVALID_URL", message: "..." } }
    else Valid URL
        Validator->>Controller: handleProcessVideo(req, res)
        Controller->>Service: processVideo({ youtubeUrl })
        Service->>Cache: Check for cached analysis
        alt Fully Cached
            Cache-->>Service: Return cached claim ledger
            Service-->>Controller: Cached ProcessVideoResult
            Controller-->>Client: 200 OK { videoId, status: "completed", claims: [...] }
        else Cache Miss
            Service->>ExtAPI: Execute Stage 1-7 Pipeline
            ExtAPI-->>Service: Fresh transcripts, evidence & verdicts
            Service->>Cache: Write to Disk, Supabase & Redis
            Service-->>Controller: Fresh ProcessVideoResult
            Controller-->>Client: 201 Created { videoId, status: "completed", claims: [...] }
        end
    end
    end

    %% Scenario B: Get Claims by Video ID
    rect rgb(245, 243, 255)
    Note over Client,ExtAPI: Flow B: Get Video Claims (GET /api/videos/:videoId/claims)
    Client->>Router: GET /api/videos/:videoId/claims
    Router->>Validator: Validate videoId UUID format
    Validator->>Controller: handleGetVideoClaims(req, res)
    Controller->>Service: getClaimsForVideo(videoId)
    alt Video Not Found
        Service-->>Controller: null
        Controller-->>Client: 404 Not Found { error: { code: "VIDEO_NOT_FOUND" } }
    else Video Exists
        Service->>Cache: Query DB for claims and verdicts
        Cache-->>Service: Claim records list with verdicts
        Service-->>Controller: Formatted claim array
        Controller-->>Client: 200 OK { videoId, claimsCount, claims: [...] }
    end
    end

    %% Scenario C: Inspect Specific Claim Evidence
    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
    Note over Client,ExtAPI: Flow C: Get Claim Evidence Details (GET /api/claims/:claimId/evidence)
    Client->>Router: GET /api/claims/:claimId/evidence
    Router->>Controller: handleGetClaimEvidence(req, res)
    Controller->>Service: getEvidenceByClaimId(claimId)
    Service->>Cache: Fetch evidence rows & link to /data/cache/*.json
    Cache-->>Service: Evidence items with rawResponseCachePath
    Service-->>Controller: Formatted evidence payload
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK { claimId, evidence: [...] }
    end
